#NEXUS

[ foth2017a_fig9: Simplified coelurosaur time tree, drawn as a staircase in which each node's stem enters the middle of its vertical at a coloured dot. Guanlong and Proceratosaurus are drawn as successive branches, not as a clade. Internal labels from the caption key: 1 Coelurosauria, 2 Maniraptoriformes, 3 Maniraptora, 4 Pennaraptora, 5 Paraves, 6 Avialae. Read by eye at 3-5x; the pixel listing failed on the coloured dots. 20 tips, 2 polytomies (3, 4 children); 6 printed clade names kept as internal node labels. Random-sample case (seed 20261114). Topology transcribed from the figure image and checked node by node; topology only. ]

